  <body dur="03:21.610">
    <div begin="00:15.970" end="03:21.610">
      <p begin="00:15.970" end="00:21.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:15.970" end="00:16.240">は</span><span begin="00:16.390" end="00:16.630">し</span><span begin="00:16.630" end="00:16.880">ゃ</span><span begin="00:16.880" end="00:17.010">ぎ</span><span begin="00:17.130" end="00:17.350">た</span><span begin="00:17.570" end="00:18.240">い</span><span begin="00:18.240" end="00:18.680">よ</span><span begin="00:18.680" end="00:19.640">昔</span><span begin="00:19.990" end="00:20.250">み</span><span begin="00:20.460" end="00:20.640">た</span><span begin="00:20.690" end="00:21.130">い</span><span begin="00:21.130" end="00:21.700">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想像从前那样尽情欢闹</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">好想像從前那樣盡情歡鬧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to frolic like in the past</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">예전처럼 마음껏 떠들며 놀고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je veux m'amuser comme autrefois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero divertirme como en los viejos tiempos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich möchte ausgelassen sein wie in alten Zeiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero me divertir como antigamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я хочу веселиться как в былые времена</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vorrei divertirmi come un tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hashagitai yo mukashi mitai ni</span></p>
      <p begin="00:23.100" end="00:28.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:23.100" end="00:23.430">無</span><span begin="00:23.560" end="00:23.850">邪</span><span begin="00:24.010" end="00:24.240">気</span><span begin="00:24.240" end="00:24.480">に</span><span begin="00:24.680" end="00:25.050">み</span><span begin="00:25.350" end="00:25.800">ん</span><span begin="00:25.800" end="00:26.060">な</span><span begin="00:26.060" end="00:26.340">で</span><span begin="00:26.460" end="00:27.670">笑</span><span begin="00:27.670" end="00:27.830">っ</span><span begin="00:27.830" end="00:28.030">て</span><span begin="00:28.240" end="00:28.610">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天真无邪地与大家一同欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">天真無邪地與大家一同歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Laughing innocently with everyone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다 함께 천진난만하게 웃으면서 말이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rire innocemment avec tout le monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Riendo todos juntos con inocencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unschuldig zusammen mit allen lachen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Rindo inocentemente com todo mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Невинно смеясь вместе со всеми</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ridendo innocentemente tutti insieme</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mujaki ni minna de waratte sa</span></p>
      <p begin="00:30.190" end="00:35.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:30.190" end="00:31.040">全</span><span begin="00:31.120" end="00:31.350">部</span><span begin="00:31.350" end="00:31.550">の</span><span begin="00:31.720" end="00:32.770">瞬</span><span begin="00:32.870" end="00:33.520">間</span> <span begin="00:33.520" end="00:33.790">シ</span><span begin="00:33.790" end="00:34.070">ャ</span><span begin="00:34.230" end="00:34.680">ボ</span><span begin="00:34.680" end="00:34.900">ン</span><span begin="00:34.900" end="00:35.960">玉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有瞬间 皆如肥皂泡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所有瞬間 皆如肥皂泡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Every moment is a soap bubble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 순간은 비눗방울처럼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque instant est une bulle de savon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todos los momentos son burbujas de jabón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jeder Moment ist eine Seifenblase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Todos os momentos são bolhas de sabão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждое мгновение это мыльный пузырь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni singolo istante è come una bolla di sapone</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zenbu no shunkan shabondama</span></p>
      <p begin="00:37.340" end="00:42.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:37.340" end="00:38.140">一</span><span begin="00:38.140" end="00:38.910">瞬</span><span begin="00:38.910" end="00:39.330">の</span><span begin="00:39.550" end="00:39.760">と</span><span begin="00:39.760" end="00:40.000">き</span><span begin="00:40.000" end="00:40.230">め</span><span begin="00:40.230" end="00:40.680">き</span><span begin="00:40.680" end="00:40.960">で</span><span begin="00:41.350" end="00:42.460">輝</span><span begin="00:42.460" end="00:42.820">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因刹那的心动而闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因剎那的心動而閃耀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Shining with a momentary thrill</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">찰나의 설렘 속에서 빛이 나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Brillant d'une palpitation éphémère</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Brillando con la emoción de un instante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die im Augenblick des Herzklopfens erstrahlt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Brilhando com a emoção de um instante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сияющий от мимолетного трепета</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che brilla con un battito di ciglia di emozione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Isshun no tokimeki de kagayaku</span></p>
      <p begin="00:43.780" end="00:50.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:43.780" end="00:44.590">私</span> <span begin="00:45.560" end="00:45.790">た</span><span begin="00:45.790" end="00:46.020">と</span><span begin="00:46.020" end="00:46.240">え</span><span begin="00:46.240" end="00:46.490">不</span><span begin="00:46.680" end="00:47.130">器</span><span begin="00:47.130" end="00:47.580">用</span><span begin="00:47.580" end="00:47.790">で</span><span begin="00:47.790" end="00:48.180">も</span> <span begin="00:48.640" end="00:49.340">諦</span><span begin="00:49.340" end="00:49.570">め</span><span begin="00:49.570" end="00:50.460">な</span><span begin="00:50.460" end="00:50.670">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使笨拙不堪 我也绝不放弃</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使笨拙不堪 我也絕不放棄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I am clumsy I will not give up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나 비록 서툴지라도 포기하지 않을 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je suis maladroite je n'abandonnerai pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo aunque sea torpe no me rendiré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst wenn ich ungeschickt bin gebe ich nicht auf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu, mesmo sendo desajeitada, não vou desistir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если я неуклюжа я не сдамся</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io anche se sono maldestra non mi arrendo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi tatoe bukiyou demo akiramenai</span></p>
      <p begin="00:50.880" end="00:57.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:50.880" end="00:51.320">悔</span><span begin="00:51.320" end="00:51.740">し</span><span begin="00:52.680" end="00:53.350">涙</span><span begin="00:53.350" end="00:53.570">な</span><span begin="00:53.570" end="00:53.790">ん</span><span begin="00:53.790" end="00:54.190">て</span><span begin="00:54.190" end="00:54.680">す</span><span begin="00:54.680" end="00:55.120">ぐ</span><span begin="00:55.120" end="00:56.020">乾</span><span begin="00:56.020" end="00:56.460">い</span><span begin="00:56.460" end="00:56.600">ち</span><span begin="00:56.600" end="00:56.740">ゃ</span><span begin="00:56.740" end="00:57.790">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不甘的泪水转眼就会干涸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不甘的淚水轉眼就會乾涸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Tears of frustration will dry right away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">분해서 흘린 눈물 따윈 금방 마를 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces larmes de frustration sécheront bien vite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las lágrimas de frustración se secarán pronto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Tränen der Frustration trocknen sofort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As lágrimas de frustração vão secar logo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слезы обиды высохнут очень быстро</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le lacrime di frustrazione si asciugano in un attimo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kuyashi namida nante sugu kawaichau</span></p>
      <p begin="00:58.000" end="01:04.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:58.000" end="00:58.220">負</span><span begin="00:58.220" end="00:58.440">け</span><span begin="00:58.440" end="00:58.680">な</span><span begin="00:58.680" end="00:59.630">い</span> <span begin="00:59.800" end="01:00.250">強</span><span begin="01:00.250" end="01:00.450">い</span><span begin="01:00.450" end="01:00.900">自</span><span begin="01:00.900" end="01:01.570">分</span><span begin="01:01.570" end="01:02.010">を</span><span begin="01:02.010" end="01:02.240">く</span><span begin="01:02.240" end="01:02.620">だ</span><span begin="01:02.620" end="01:02.900">さ</span><span begin="01:02.900" end="01:04.430">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请赐予我不服输的坚强自我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請賜予我不服輸的堅強自我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please give me a strong self that will not lose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지지 않는 강인한 내가 될 수 있게 해줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Donne-moi la force de ne jamais m'avouer vaincue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dame una yo fuerte que no sea derrotada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gib mir ein starkes Ich das niemals aufgibt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por favor, me dê um eu forte que não se rende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Дай мне ту сильную меня что никогда не сдается</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non perderò dammi una me forte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Makenai tsuyoi jibun o kudasai</span></p>
      <p begin="01:05.120" end="01:11.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:05.120" end="01:05.350">お</span><span begin="01:05.350" end="01:05.800">願</span><span begin="01:05.800" end="01:06.850">い</span> <span begin="01:06.910" end="01:07.130">ど</span><span begin="01:07.130" end="01:07.350">う</span><span begin="01:07.350" end="01:07.580">か</span><span begin="01:07.580" end="01:08.250">願</span><span begin="01:08.250" end="01:08.730">い</span><span begin="01:08.730" end="01:09.130">を</span> <span begin="01:09.130" end="01:09.770">叶</span><span begin="01:09.770" end="01:10.020">え</span><span begin="01:10.020" end="01:11.470">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 无论如何请让愿望实现</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">拜託了 無論如何請讓願望實現</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please somehow grant my wish</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부탁이야 부디 이 소원을 이루어 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t'en prie exauce mon vœu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por favor de alguna manera haz que mi deseo se cumpla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich flehe dich an bitte erfülle meinen Wunsch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu peço, por favor, realize o meu desejo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу умоляю исполни мое желание</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti prego avvera il mio desiderio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onegai douka negai o kanaete</span></p>
      <p begin="01:11.810" end="01:13.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:11.810" end="01:12.010">I</span> <span begin="01:12.010" end="01:12.500">do</span> <span begin="01:12.500" end="01:12.910">my</span> <span begin="01:12.910" end="01:13.760">best</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我竭尽全力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我竭盡全力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ベストを尽くす</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 모든 걸 다할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ferai de mon mieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Doy lo mejor de mí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich gebe mein Bestes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu dou o meu melhor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я стараюсь изо всех сил</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Farò del mio meglio</span></p>
      <p begin="01:14.650" end="01:20.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:14.650" end="01:14.900">自</span><span begin="01:15.130" end="01:16.010">分</span><span begin="01:16.010" end="01:16.220">を</span><span begin="01:16.220" end="01:17.300">愛</span><span begin="01:17.300" end="01:17.570">し</span><span begin="01:17.570" end="01:17.800">て</span><span begin="01:18.020" end="01:18.250">あ</span><span begin="01:18.660" end="01:19.130">げ</span><span begin="01:19.130" end="01:19.340">な</span><span begin="01:19.340" end="01:19.580">い</span><span begin="01:19.770" end="01:20.120">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若不能先爱上自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若不能先愛上自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If I do not love myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나 자신을 사랑해 주지 않으면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si je ne m'accorde pas d'amour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si no me amo a mí misma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich mich nicht selbst liebe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eu não amar a mim mesma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь если я не буду любить себя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non inizi ad amare te stessa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jibun o aishite agenai to</span></p>
      <p begin="01:21.780" end="01:27.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:21.780" end="01:22.670">誰</span><span begin="01:22.670" end="01:22.910">か</span><span begin="01:22.910" end="01:23.130">に</span><span begin="01:23.350" end="01:23.980">愛</span><span begin="01:23.980" end="01:24.240">を</span><span begin="01:24.440" end="01:24.680">あ</span><span begin="01:24.680" end="01:25.130">げ</span><span begin="01:25.130" end="01:25.430">ら</span><span begin="01:25.780" end="01:26.240">れ</span><span begin="01:26.240" end="01:26.460">な</span><span begin="01:26.460" end="01:26.900">い</span><span begin="01:26.900" end="01:27.140">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便无法将爱给予他人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">便無法將愛給予他人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I cannot give love to anyone else</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다른 누군가에게 사랑을 줄 수 없는걸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne pourrai pas en donner aux autres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No puedo darle amor a nadie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann ich auch niemandem Liebe schenken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não poderei dar amor a mais ninguém</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">То не смогу дарить любовь другим</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non puoi dare amore a nessun altro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dareka ni ai o agerarenai no</span></p>
      <p begin="01:28.220" end="01:34.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:28.220" end="01:28.680">人</span><span begin="01:28.680" end="01:29.030">と</span><span begin="01:29.990" end="01:30.450">比</span><span begin="01:30.450" end="01:30.670">べ</span><span begin="01:30.670" end="01:31.120">て</span><span begin="01:31.120" end="01:31.420">も</span><span begin="01:31.570" end="01:32.010">意</span><span begin="01:32.010" end="01:32.240">味</span><span begin="01:32.240" end="01:32.600">が</span><span begin="01:33.350" end="01:33.800">な</span><span begin="01:33.800" end="01:34.020">い</span><span begin="01:34.020" end="01:34.690">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与他人比较也毫无意义</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與他人比較也毫無意義</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There is no meaning in comparing with others</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남과 비교하는 건 아무 의미 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ça ne rime à rien de se comparer aux autres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No tiene sentido compararme con los demás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sich mit anderen zu vergleichen hat keinen Sinn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não faz sentido se comparar com os outros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нет никакого смысла сравнивать себя с другими</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Confrontarsi con gli altri non ha alcun senso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito to kurabetemo imi ga nai yo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:35.330" end="01:42.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:35.330" end="01:36.060">私</span><span begin="01:37.130" end="01:37.310">は</span><span begin="01:37.310" end="01:38.220">私</span><span begin="01:38.220" end="01:38.680">し</span><span begin="01:38.680" end="01:39.130">か</span><span begin="01:39.130" end="01:39.570">い</span><span begin="01:39.570" end="01:40.460">な</span><span begin="01:40.460" end="01:40.900">い</span><span begin="01:40.900" end="01:41.170">か</span><span begin="01:41.170" end="01:42.220">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为这世上只有一个我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為這世上只有一個我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I am the only me there is</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 나 하나뿐이니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Car je suis la seule et unique moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque solo hay una yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn es gibt mich nur ein einziges Mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque só existe uma de mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь я у себя только одна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché ci sono solo io al mondo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi wa watashi shika inai kara</span></p>
      <p begin="01:42.450" end="01:48.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:42.450" end="01:42.690">負</span><span begin="01:42.690" end="01:42.910">け</span><span begin="01:42.910" end="01:43.160">な</span><span begin="01:43.160" end="01:44.110">い</span> <span begin="01:44.230" end="01:44.680">強</span><span begin="01:44.680" end="01:44.900">い</span><span begin="01:44.900" end="01:45.350">自</span><span begin="01:45.350" end="01:46.020">分</span><span begin="01:46.020" end="01:46.340">を</span><span begin="01:46.460" end="01:46.680">く</span><span begin="01:46.680" end="01:47.120">だ</span><span begin="01:47.120" end="01:47.410">さ</span><span begin="01:47.410" end="01:48.890">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请赐予我不服输的坚强自我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請賜予我不服輸的堅強自我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please give me a strong self that will not lose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지지 않는 강인한 내가 될 수 있게 해줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Donne-moi la force de ne jamais m'avouer vaincue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dame una yo fuerte que no sea derrotada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gib mir ein starkes Ich das niemals aufgibt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por favor, me dê um eu forte que não se rende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Дай мне ту сильную меня что никогда не сдается</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non perderò dammi una me forte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Makenai tsuyoi jibun o kudasai</span></p>
      <p begin="01:49.560" end="01:55.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:49.560" end="01:49.790">お</span><span begin="01:49.790" end="01:50.240">願</span><span begin="01:50.240" end="01:51.350">い</span> <span begin="01:51.350" end="01:51.570">ど</span><span begin="01:51.570" end="01:51.790">う</span><span begin="01:51.790" end="01:52.010">か</span><span begin="01:52.010" end="01:52.700">願</span><span begin="01:52.700" end="01:53.160">い</span><span begin="01:53.160" end="01:53.550">を</span> <span begin="01:53.550" end="01:54.210">叶</span><span begin="01:54.210" end="01:54.470">え</span><span begin="01:54.470" end="01:55.880">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 无论如何请让愿望实现</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">拜託了 無論如何請讓願望實現</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please somehow grant my wish</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부탁이야 부디 이 소원을 이루어 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t'en prie exauce mon vœu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por favor de alguna manera haz que mi deseo se cumpla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich flehe dich an bitte erfülle meinen Wunsch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu peço, por favor, realize o meu desejo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу умоляю исполни мое желание</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti prego avvera il mio desiderio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onegai douka negai o kanaete</span></p>
      <p begin="01:56.240" end="01:58.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:56.240" end="01:56.460">I</span> <span begin="01:56.460" end="01:56.920">do</span> <span begin="01:56.920" end="01:57.370">my</span> <span begin="01:57.370" end="01:58.170">best</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我竭尽全力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我竭盡全力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ベストを尽くす</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 모든 걸 다할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ferai de mon mieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Doy lo mejor de mí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich gebe mein Bestes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu dou o meu melhor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я стараюсь изо всех сил</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Farò del mio meglio</span></p>
      <p begin="02:00.100" end="02:01.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:00.100" end="02:00.230">あ</span><span begin="02:00.230" end="02:00.260">、</span><span begin="02:00.750" end="02:00.840">止</span><span begin="02:00.840" end="02:00.920">ま</span><span begin="02:00.920" end="02:00.990">っ</span><span begin="02:00.990" end="02:01.040">ち</span><span begin="02:01.040" end="02:01.090">ゃ</span><span begin="02:01.090" end="02:01.220">っ</span><span begin="02:01.220" end="02:01.350">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊，停下来了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊，停下來了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah, it stopped</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아 노래가 멈춰버렸네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah la musique s'est arrêtée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah, se detuvo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah es hat angehalten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah, parou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах музыка остановилась</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah si è fermato tutto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">A, tomacchatta</span></p>
      <p begin="02:01.670" end="02:03.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:01.670" end="02:01.740">じ</span><span begin="02:01.740" end="02:01.800">ゃ</span><span begin="02:01.800" end="02:01.870">あ</span><span begin="02:01.870" end="02:02.030">皆</span><span begin="02:02.030" end="02:02.120">さ</span><span begin="02:02.120" end="02:02.210">ん</span><span begin="02:02.460" end="02:02.540">ク</span><span begin="02:02.540" end="02:02.630">ラ</span><span begin="02:02.630" end="02:02.740">ッ</span><span begin="02:02.740" end="02:02.810">プ</span><span begin="02:02.810" end="02:02.970">で</span><span begin="02:03.230" end="02:03.400">歌</span><span begin="02:03.400" end="02:03.480">い</span><span begin="02:03.480" end="02:03.560">ま</span><span begin="02:03.560" end="02:03.640">し</span><span begin="02:03.640" end="02:03.770">ょ</span><span begin="02:03.770" end="02:03.820">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么请大家伴着掌声唱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那麼請大家伴著掌聲唱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Then everyone let's sing with claps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그럼 여러분 다 함께 박수 치며 불러봐요</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors tout le monde chantons en tapant dans nos mains</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entonces todos cantemos aplaudiendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Also lasst uns alle klatschen und singen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então pessoal, vamos cantar batendo palmas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тогда давайте все вместе споем хлопая в ладоши</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Allora cantiamo battendo le mani tutti quanti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jaa minasan kurappu de utaimashou</span></p>
      <p begin="02:04.420" end="02:05.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:04.420" end="02:04.900">Tell</span> <span begin="02:04.900" end="02:05.190">me</span> <span begin="02:05.330" end="02:05.790">tell</span> <span begin="02:05.790" end="02:05.990">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 告诉我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">告訴我 告訴我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">教えて 教えて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내게 말해줘 내게 말해줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dis-moi dis-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dime dime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sag mir sag mir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Me diga me diga</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скажи мне скажи мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimmi dimmi</span></p>
      <p begin="02:05.990" end="02:07.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:05.990" end="02:06.880">鏡</span><span begin="02:06.880" end="02:07.110">よ</span><span begin="02:07.110" end="02:07.820">鏡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">魔镜啊魔镜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">魔鏡啊魔鏡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Mirror mirror</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거울아 거울아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Miroir mon beau miroir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Espejito espejito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Spieglein Spieglein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Espelho, espelho meu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Свет мой зеркальце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Specchio specchio delle mie brame</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kagami yo kagami</span></p>
      <p begin="02:07.820" end="02:11.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:07.820" end="02:08.450">一</span><span begin="02:08.450" end="02:08.870">番</span><span begin="02:08.870" end="02:09.120">好</span><span begin="02:09.120" end="02:09.350">き</span><span begin="02:09.350" end="02:09.570">な</span><span begin="02:09.570" end="02:10.470">私</span><span begin="02:10.470" end="02:10.680">に</span><span begin="02:10.680" end="02:10.900">な</span><span begin="02:10.900" end="02:11.110">る</span><span begin="02:11.110" end="02:11.320">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能否成为最喜欢的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我能否成為最喜歡的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I will become the me I like the most</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 가장 좋아하는 내가 될 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vais devenir la moi que j'aime le plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me convertiré en la yo que más me gusta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde das Ich das ich am meisten liebe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou me tornar a versão de mim que mais amo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я стану той версией себя которую люблю больше всего</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Voglio diventare la me che amo di più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ichiban sukina watashi ni naru no</span></p>
      <p begin="02:11.560" end="02:13.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:11.560" end="02:12.000">Tell</span> <span begin="02:12.000" end="02:12.310">me</span> <span begin="02:12.430" end="02:12.900">tell</span> <span begin="02:12.900" end="02:13.110">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 告诉我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">告訴我 告訴我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">教えて 教えて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내게 말해줘 내게 말해줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dis-moi dis-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dime dime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sag mir sag mir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Me diga me diga</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скажи мне скажи мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimmi dimmi</span></p>
      <p begin="02:13.110" end="02:14.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:13.110" end="02:14.020">鏡</span><span begin="02:14.020" end="02:14.230">よ</span><span begin="02:14.230" end="02:14.860">鏡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">魔镜啊魔镜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">魔鏡啊魔鏡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Mirror mirror</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거울아 거울아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Miroir mon beau miroir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Espejito espejito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Spieglein Spieglein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Espelho, espelho meu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Свет мой зеркальце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Specchio specchio delle mie brame</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kagami yo kagami</span></p>
      <p begin="02:15.100" end="02:20.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:15.100" end="02:15.560">一</span><span begin="02:15.560" end="02:15.980">番</span><span begin="02:15.980" end="02:16.250">好</span><span begin="02:16.250" end="02:16.460">き</span><span begin="02:16.460" end="02:16.710">な</span><span begin="02:16.710" end="02:17.590">私</span><span begin="02:17.590" end="02:17.790">に</span><span begin="02:17.790" end="02:18.030">な</span><span begin="02:18.030" end="02:18.230">る</span><span begin="02:18.230" end="02:20.300">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能否成为最喜欢的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我能否成為最喜歡的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I will become the me I like the most</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 가장 좋아하는 내가 될 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vais devenir la moi que j'aime le plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me convertiré en la yo que más me gusta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde das Ich das ich am meisten liebe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou me tornar a versão de mim que mais amo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я стану той версией себя которую люблю больше всего</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Voglio diventare la me che amo di più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ichiban sukina watashi ni naru no</span></p>
      <p begin="02:22.230" end="02:28.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:22.230" end="02:22.540">あ</span><span begin="02:22.670" end="02:22.950">な</span><span begin="02:23.130" end="02:23.380">た</span><span begin="02:23.590" end="02:23.840">と</span><span begin="02:24.020" end="02:25.270">私</span><span begin="02:25.730" end="02:26.230">つ</span><span begin="02:26.230" end="02:26.520">な</span><span begin="02:26.680" end="02:26.990">が</span><span begin="02:27.160" end="02:27.580">っ</span><span begin="02:27.580" end="02:28.040">て</span><span begin="02:28.040" end="02:28.480">る</span><span begin="02:28.480" end="02:28.860">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你与我紧密相连</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你與我緊密相連</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You and I are connected</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">당신과 나는 이어져 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toi et moi sommes connectés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú y yo estamos conectados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du und ich wir sind miteinander verbunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você e eu estamos conectados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты и я мы связаны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io e te siamo connesse</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Anata to watashi tsunagatteru yo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:29.310" end="02:38.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:29.310" end="02:29.640">世</span><span begin="02:29.780" end="02:30.620">界</span><span begin="02:30.680" end="02:31.110">で</span><span begin="02:31.110" end="02:31.870">一</span><span begin="02:32.010" end="02:32.170">つ</span> <span begin="02:32.690" end="02:32.920">オ</span><span begin="02:32.920" end="02:33.100">リ</span><span begin="02:33.100" end="02:33.330">ジ</span><span begin="02:33.330" end="02:33.590">ナ</span><span begin="02:33.590" end="02:33.710">ル</span><span begin="02:33.710" end="02:33.820">ス</span><span begin="02:33.820" end="02:34.240">ト</span><span begin="02:34.240" end="02:34.460">リ</span><span begin="02:34.460" end="02:34.680">ー</span><span begin="02:34.680" end="02:35.110">は</span><span begin="02:35.360" end="02:35.620">無</span><span begin="02:35.620" end="02:36.250">限</span><span begin="02:36.250" end="02:38.470">大</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界唯一的原创故事无限延伸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">世界唯一的原創故事無限延伸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">One in the world the original story is infinite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세상에 단 하나뿐인 나만의 이야기는 무한해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une histoire originale et unique au monde aux possibilités infinies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Única en el mundo la historia original es infinita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Einzigartig auf der Welt diese originelle Geschichte ist grenzenlos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Única no mundo, a história original é infinita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Единственная в мире оригинальная история бесконечна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Unico al mondo la storia originale è infinita</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sekai de hitotsu orijinaru sutoorii wa mugendai</span></p>
      <p begin="02:39.120" end="02:45.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:39.120" end="02:39.780">誰</span><span begin="02:39.780" end="02:40.040">に</span><span begin="02:40.040" end="02:41.300">も</span> <span begin="02:41.780" end="02:42.120">真</span><span begin="02:42.120" end="02:42.440">似</span><span begin="02:42.440" end="02:42.670">は</span><span begin="02:42.670" end="02:43.030">で</span><span begin="02:43.030" end="02:43.340">き</span><span begin="02:43.340" end="02:43.630">な</span><span begin="02:43.630" end="02:45.230">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任谁都无法模仿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">任誰都無法模仿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">No one can imitate it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 누구도 흉내 낼 수 없는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Personne ne pourra jamais l'imiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nadie puede imitarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Niemand kann sie nachahmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ninguém consegue imitar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Никто не сможет это повторить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nessuno può imitarla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dare ni mo mane wa dekinai</span></p>
      <p begin="02:45.720" end="02:49.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:45.720" end="02:46.660">儚</span><span begin="02:46.660" end="02:47.080">い</span><span begin="02:47.080" end="02:48.600">瞬</span><span begin="02:48.900" end="02:49.790">間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这刹那的绚烂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這剎那的絢爛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A fleeting moment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">덧없는 이 순간</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un instant éphémère</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un momento efímero</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein flüchtiger Moment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um momento efêmero</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эфемерное мгновение</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un istante effimero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hakanai shunkan</span></p>
      <p begin="02:50.010" end="02:56.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:50.010" end="02:50.220">負</span><span begin="02:50.220" end="02:50.440">け</span><span begin="02:50.440" end="02:50.680">な</span><span begin="02:50.680" end="02:51.630">い</span> <span begin="02:51.780" end="02:52.240">強</span><span begin="02:52.240" end="02:52.450">い</span><span begin="02:52.450" end="02:52.900">自</span><span begin="02:52.900" end="02:53.570">分</span><span begin="02:53.570" end="02:54.010">を</span><span begin="02:54.010" end="02:54.240">く</span><span begin="02:54.240" end="02:54.620">だ</span><span begin="02:54.620" end="02:54.910">さ</span><span begin="02:54.910" end="02:56.440">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请赐予我不服输的坚强自我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請賜予我不服輸的堅強自我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please give me a strong self that will not lose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지지 않는 강인한 내가 될 수 있게 해줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Donne-moi la force de ne jamais m'avouer vaincue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dame una yo fuerte que no sea derrotada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gib mir ein starkes Ich das niemals aufgibt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por favor, me dê um eu forte que não se rende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Дай мне ту сильную меня что никогда не сдается</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non perderò dammi una me forte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Makenai tsuyoi jibun o kudasai</span></p>
      <p begin="02:57.120" end="03:03.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:57.120" end="02:57.340">お</span><span begin="02:57.340" end="02:57.790">願</span><span begin="02:57.790" end="02:58.840">い</span> <span begin="02:58.900" end="02:59.120">ど</span><span begin="02:59.120" end="02:59.340">う</span><span begin="02:59.340" end="02:59.570">か</span><span begin="02:59.570" end="03:00.240">願</span><span begin="03:00.240" end="03:00.720">い</span><span begin="03:00.720" end="03:01.120">を</span> <span begin="03:01.120" end="03:01.760">叶</span><span begin="03:01.760" end="03:02.010">え</span><span begin="03:02.010" end="03:03.450">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 无论如何请让愿望实现</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">拜託了 無論如何請讓願望實現</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please somehow grant my wish</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부탁이야 부디 이 소원을 이루어 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t'en prie exauce mon vœu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por favor de alguna manera haz que mi deseo se cumpla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich flehe dich an bitte erfülle meinen Wunsch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu peço, por favor, realize o meu desejo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу умоляю исполни мое желание</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti prego avvera il mio desiderio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onegai douka negai o kanaete</span></p>
      <p begin="03:03.790" end="03:05.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:03.790" end="03:04.010">I</span> <span begin="03:04.010" end="03:04.460">do</span> <span begin="03:04.460" end="03:04.900">my</span> <span begin="03:04.900" end="03:05.740">best</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我竭尽全力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我竭盡全力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ベストを尽くす</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 모든 걸 다할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ferai de mon mieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Doy lo mejor de mí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich gebe mein Bestes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu dou o meu melhor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я стараюсь изо всех сил</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Farò del mio meglio</span></p>
      <p begin="03:11.340" end="03:19.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:11.340" end="03:11.570">お</span><span begin="03:11.570" end="03:12.020">願</span><span begin="03:12.020" end="03:13.070">い</span> <span begin="03:13.130" end="03:13.350">ど</span><span begin="03:13.350" end="03:13.570">う</span><span begin="03:13.570" end="03:13.800">か</span><span begin="03:13.800" end="03:14.470">願</span><span begin="03:14.470" end="03:14.950">い</span><span begin="03:14.950" end="03:15.350">を</span> <span begin="03:15.350" end="03:16.020">叶</span><span begin="03:16.020" end="03:16.300">え</span><span begin="03:16.300" end="03:19.160">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 无论如何请让愿望实现</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">拜託了 無論如何請讓願望實現</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please somehow grant my wish</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부탁이야 부디 이 소원을 이루어 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t'en prie exauce mon vœu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por favor de alguna manera haz que mi deseo se cumpla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich flehe dich an bitte erfülle meinen Wunsch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu peço, por favor, realize o meu desejo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу умоляю исполни мое желание</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti prego avvera il mio desiderio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onegai douka negai o kanaete</span></p>
      <p begin="03:19.760" end="03:21.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:19.760" end="03:20.000">I</span> <span begin="03:20.000" end="03:20.440">do</span> <span begin="03:20.440" end="03:20.920">my</span> <span begin="03:20.920" end="03:21.610">best</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我竭尽全力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我竭盡全力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ベストを尽くす</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 모든 걸 다할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ferai de mon mieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Doy lo mejor de mí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich gebe mein Bestes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu dou o meu melhor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я стараюсь изо всех сил</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Farò del mio meglio</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
